N-equation (energy constraint) : a0**3*(q0*Derivative(eps(q0), q0) - eps(q0)) = 0
a-equation (pressure) : 3*a0**2*(q0*Derivative(eps(q0), q0) - eps(q0)) = 0
A-equation : 0 = 0
p_A = dL/dA_dot at static flat point : -Derivative(eps(q0), q0)  (conserved; define mu = -p_A)
=> static flat solution requires eps(q0) - q0*eps'(q0) = 0 and mu = eps'(q0); Omega, beta drop out.
